# The `start` command's mosaic tiles are committed alongside the rest of
# `output/`, but the index page listing them is not. It links every drawing
# rather than inlining it, so it duplicates nothing — it is left out because
# it is a megabyte of generated markup whose every tile identifier would then
# be spell-checked, and because it is rebuilt in under a second by
# `nx run meanderaw:start` whenever it is wanted.
applications/meanderaw/index.html
vite.config.*.timestamp*
data/**
.fallow

# project-structure plugin cache
projectStructure.cache.json


# ESLint incremental cache (restored in CI by the Lint Codebase workflow)
.eslintcache/
